{"seq":2,"slug":"habitability-conditions","title":"宜居性条件（Habitability Conditions）","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/habitability-conditions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"habitable-zone-concept","title":"宜居带概念（Habitable Zone Concept）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/habitability-conditions/habitable-zone-concept","wordCount":2315,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"water-habitability","title":"水与宜居性（Water and Habitability）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/habitability-conditions/water-habitability","wordCount":2124,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"planetary-protection","title":"行星保护（Planetary Protection）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/habitability-conditions/planetary-protection","wordCount":2152,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"宜居性条件-habitability-conditions\">宜居性条件（Habitability Conditions）</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>宜居性是天体生物学的核心概念：什么样的环境条件能够支持生命的起源、维持和演化？本章从宜居带的天文学定义、水在生命中的关键角色，到行星保护的伦理与技术实践，系统阐述判断一个天体是否可能孕育生命的科学框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心议题\">核心议题</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>议题</th>\n<th>关键问题</th>\n<th>判断标准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>宜居带</td>\n<td>液态水稳定存在的轨道范围</td>\n<td>恒星光度、行星大气、反照率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水与宜居性</td>\n<td>水为何是生命溶剂的最佳选择</td>\n<td>物理化学特性、普遍性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行星保护</td>\n<td>如何防止地球生物污染其他天体</td>\n<td>COSPAR分类、净化标准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><p>本章三篇文档从宏观到实践递进：宜居带概念（天文学尺度）→ 水与宜居性（化学尺度）→ 行星保护（工程与伦理尺度），构建从理论判断到实际操作的完整知识链。</p>\n"}